OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry
OL,6,Fevening with clear spells. Staying dry
OL,7,Fin the east overnight but clouding
OL,8,Fover in the west with patchy rain
OL,9,Fpossible towards Skye and Eilean Siar.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FRather cloudy through the day
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of patchy light
OL,13,Frain.Feeling warm in the best of the
OL,14,Fbrightness towards Inverness and
OL,15,FNairn. Rain turning heavier in the
OL,16,Fevening. Occasionally windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
