OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FOvernight rain clearing Tuesday
OL,7,Fmorning, then sunshine and blustery
OL,8,Fshowers. Cloudy and very windy with
OL,9,Fgales on Wednesday and occasionally
OL,10,Fheavy rain later, this gradually
OL,11,Fclearing southeast through Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
